        "TileImage": "$($repository c823beec-3d73-47b6-87d9-076c384c4662).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47. The targets today for our third contract are two of Netanyahu&apos;s top associates. The priest of the local town, Spaienza, is the number one supplier of child soldiers for the IDF. The guard in the Ether Corporation field lab, on the other hand, has been selling the secrets of Ether to Netanyahu, potentially allowing him to create a biological weapon of mass destruction. It&apos;s important we get this done, 47. Also, please wear funny disguises when you kill them. I need a laugh.",
